            "review_title": "Review at Paoli Sweet Present",
            "review_text": "Oanh N\n2 contributions\n0\nThe Best Gelato Spot in Saigon!\nJul 2025 • Solo\nIf you’re looking for authentic, creamy, and beautifully presented gelato in Ho Chi Minh City, Paoli is a must-visit. Every scoop is bursting with flavor — from classic Fior di Latte to unique Vietnamese-inspired blends. The orange milk with variegato swirl was absolutely my favorite! The shop has a cozy pastel design, friendly staff, and great attention to detail. A sweet experience that makes me want to come back again (and again)! 🍨💛\nRead more\nWritten July 28, 2025",
